{
  "Npc": "son",
  "EntryOption": "LWN_story_son_entry",
  "EntryOptionZh": "[说两句] 这墙头是你的地盘？",
  "EntryNode": "son_intro",
  "Nodes": [
    {
      "Id": "son_intro",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_intro",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：嘘——小点声！这墙根我蹲了三年，风大看得远。\n（小贼，玩家）：看你这步子，刚从城门那儿碰了一鼻子灰吧？",
      "EnterAction": "PROBE:mark",
      "EnterParam": "met",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_wall",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[搭话] 你天天蹲在这墙根底下看什么？",
          "Once": "ask_wall",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "ask_wall",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_ask_wall"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_climb",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[打听] 正门被堵死了，怎么才能翻进去？",
          "Once": "ask_climb",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "ask_climb",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_ask_climb"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_sister",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[打听] 你整天蹲在墙头，见过一个穿青布的姑娘吗？",
          "Once": "ask_sister",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark+clue",
          "ActionParam": "ask_sister;sister_5",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_ask_sister"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_deal",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[求门路] 把你的飞钩借我用用。",
          "Requires": "!quest_accepted,!quest_turned,asked:ask_wall",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_deal"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_chat",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[叙旧] 这两天墙头上有什么新动静？",
          "Requires": "quest_turned",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_chat"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_money",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[塞钱] 四十第纳尔，买个准信。",
          "Requires": "step>=1,gold>=40,asked:ask_climb,asked:ask_sister",
          "Once": "son_money",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "son_money",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_money_open"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_hub",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_hub",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：还有什么事，快说。",
      "Transitions": [
