    {
      "Id": "son_ask_wall",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_ask_wall",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：看谁身上带了沉钱袋，看谁走的是背光巷子。\n（小贼，玩家）：我娘在那边戏台唱戏，我在这儿替夜行会盯梢。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_ask_climb",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_ask_climb",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：瞧见城门上方那根横梁没有？有飞钩，三丈高的墙跟平地一样。\n（小贼，玩家）：可惜我那副好钩子，昨天让一伙野贼给抢了。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_climb2",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[追问] 谁敢抢夜行会的东西？",
          "Once": "climb_more",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "climb_more",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_ask_climb_2"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_ask_climb_2",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_ask_climb_2",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：那帮野贼不守夜行会的规矩，硬抢东西还掰伤了我一根手指。\n（小贼，玩家）：我要不是手伤了，早去把场子找回来了。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_ask_sister",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_ask_sister",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：上个月半夜，我见码头帮两个人架着个穿青布的女子走后巷。\n（小贼，玩家）：嘴里堵着布，走得急，我蹲在瓦上没敢往下看。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_sister2",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[追问] 那天夜里他们把人押去哪了？",
          "Once": "sister_more",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "sister_more",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_ask_sister_2"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_ask_sister_2",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_ask_sister_2",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：那天我正摸进绸缎庄顺东西，出声我自己也得折进去。\n（小贼，玩家）：不过他们去的方向，肯定是大西门里头的私仓。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_deal",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_deal",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：想要飞钩翻墙？东西可以归你，但你得替我出这口气。\n（小贼，玩家）：那伙野贼就窝在西墙根塌马厩那儿，去把他们打发走。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_take_job",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[应下] 这活我接了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_quest_accept"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_why",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[反问] 你自己的场子，怎么不自己去找回来？",
          "Once": "son_why",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "son_why",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_deal_why"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_refuse",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[缓一缓] 我不替小偷打架。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_deal_refuse"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_deal_why",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_deal_why",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：我这根手指肿成这样，哪还敢去找他们？\n（小贼，玩家）：让那领头的别再抢我的买卖，备用钩索和撬锁包全归你。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_take_job",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[应下] 这活我接了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_quest_accept"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_deal_refuse",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_deal_refuse",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：不干拉倒。\n（小贼，玩家）：没我的飞钩，你就慢慢在城门底下跟铁头耗着吧。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_quest_accept",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_quest_accept",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：野贼头子就在西边墙根转悠。\n（小贼，玩家）：拆穿他的底细也好，打一顿也好，让他收手，回来拿钩子。",
      "EnterAction": "PROBE:accept_quest",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_turnin",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_turnin",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：墙根那个野贼，还会来抢我的东西吗？\n（玩家，小贼）：他已经服软，这事过去了。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_turnin_ok",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[交差] 墙根那伙野贼已经打发了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_turnin_ok"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_turnin_ok",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_turnin_ok",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：够爷们！这副钩索绳、铁钩还有撬锁包，我擦了一宿，全归你。\n（小贼，玩家）：趁守门那家伙转头时往梁上勾，千万别当着他的面飞。",
      "EnterAction": "PROBE:turn_in",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_chat",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_chat",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：来了？我娘今天又拧我耳朵，骂我跟生人鬼混。\n（小贼，玩家）：我说我认了个一拳能打趴野贼的大哥，她还不信。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_work",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[请教] 除了钩索翻墙，过门还有什么巧办法？",
          "Once": "son_chat_2",
          "Action": "PROBE:mark",
          "ActionParam": "son_chat_2",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_chat_2"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_chat_2",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_chat_2",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：铁头腰上那把佩刀松得很，你从背后摸过去就能顺下来。\n（小贼，玩家）：要是手底下利索，蹲着贴墙根也能趁他转头溜进去。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "event_4_join",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_event4_join",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，小贼）：小贼！把我柜上的零钱袋交出来！\n（小贼，老周）：冤枉啊周掌柜！我今天连你摊子三尺内都没进过！",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_event4_opt_defend",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[劝解] 掌柜的先摸摸账本底下，当街冤枉人可坏名声。",
          "CheckType": "SkillCheck",
          "CheckTag": "son|charm",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "event_4_win",
          "NextNodeOnFail": "event_4_lose"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_event4_opt_ask",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[插话] 慢着，到底丢了什么东西？",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "event_4_ask"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_event4_opt_walk",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[走开] 抓贼的事我不掺和。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "event_4_ask",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_event4_ask",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：柜角一袋散碎铜子不见了，刚才就这小子从檐下溜过去！\n（小贼，玩家）：周掌柜，您再翻翻您那厚账本底下，真不在我袖子里！",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_event4_opt_defend",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[劝解] 掌柜的先摸摸账本底下，当街冤枉人可坏名声。",
          "CheckType": "SkillCheck",
          "CheckTag": "son|charm",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "event_4_win",
          "NextNodeOnFail": "event_4_lose"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_event4_opt_walk",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[走开] 抓贼的事我不掺和。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "event_4_win",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_event4_win",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，小贼）：……摸到了，压在账本底下。算我老眼昏花，莫怪。\n（小贼，玩家）：谢了兄弟，要不是你拦着，我这只手又得挨顿拧。",
      "EnterAction": "PROBE:resolve_event",
      "EnterParam": "4|nightwalkers|5",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_event_opt_followup",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[跟他说两句]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_negative",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "event_4_lose",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_event4_lose",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（老周，玩家）：你又是哪冒出来的？跟这小毛贼一伙的吧？\n（小贼，玩家）：……你别越帮越忙啊！",
      "EnterAction": "PROBE:hazard",
      "EnterParam": "event4_lost",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_event_opt_followup",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[跟他说两句]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_opt_leave",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[离开]",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": ""
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_closed_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_negative"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_money_open",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_money_open",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：还是你懂夜行会的规矩。\n（小贼，玩家）：四十第纳尔拿来，你想知道哪条暗道？",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_pay",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[数出四十第纳尔] 门上那根梁，到底哪截结实？",
          "Requires": "gold>=40",
          "Action": "PROBE:offer_money",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_money_taken"
        },
        {
          "PlayerKey": "LWN_story_son_opt_back",
          "PlayerKeyZh": "[收住] 别的先不问了。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "son_hub"
        }
      ],
      "NpcActions": [
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial",
        "act_conversation_confident_trivial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "son_money_taken",
      "NpcKey": "LWN_story_son_money_taken",
      "NpcKeyZh": "（小贼，玩家）：城门上那根横梁，西头朽了，正中那一截最结实。\n（小贼，玩家）：守门那家伙从不抬头，你勾中间保准稳当。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
